Warning [L0101] (unused_local_binding): Local binding `unused` is never read.
  --> tests/ui_lint/unused_reads_in_task_and_lambda_bodies.jet:18:5
    |
 18 |     unused :: 5
    |     ^^^^^^
 Why: A binding that no later expression reads adds dead code and may hide a computed result that should have been used.
 Fix: Remove the binding when its initializer is side-effect free, or rename `unused` to `_unused` when the value must be computed.
More: jet-lang.dev/e/L0101
